t take this decisive step to secure this deposit, and invest it The late Scanner was also a friend in addition to our business relationship. I will wait for your reaction and response and then together we can jumpstart this project and nurture it to reality. Please, make sure you respond through this my confidential email address: williamsjruphus@katamail.com or williamsruphuseq@jmail.co.zaYour swift response is anticipated. Yours faithfully Jerome Williams Lewis Esq.",d01,Banking and Financial Services,"GENERAL SETTINGS
