HE IMMEDIATE PROCESS TO RELEASE YOUR UNCLAIMED FUND WITH AFRICA. THE MANAGEMENT ARE THEREFORE APOLOGIZED YOU FOR ANY FORM OF DELAY THIS MIGHT HAVE ENCOUNTERED YOU IN THE COURSE OF THE TRANSFER. WE ARE POISED TO SERVE YOU BETTER. REGARDS. MR.GREG BARNARD",d06,Employment and Recruitment,"GENERAL SETTINGS
