w. [A] COMPANY? S NAME BENEFICIARY ACCOUNT. [B] YOUR PERSONAL TELEPHONE NUMBER AND FAX NUMBERS. [C] BANKACCOUNT/SORT/ABA/ROUTING NUMBERS WHICH THE FUND WILL BE TRANSFERRED TO.[D]YOUR BANK ADDRESS, TELEPHONE NUMBERS/FAX NUMBERS. The above information will enable us commence the transfer of this funds into your account in your country without delay and also to open an account in your name. We are looking forward to doing this business with you and solicit your confidentiality in this transaction. Please acknowledge the receipt of this letter using the above email address; I will bring you into the complete picture of this pending project when I hear from you. With Kind regards, DR.JOHNSON KW ESI ",d07,Business Services and Partnerships,"GENERAL SETTINGS
