er to enable me contact you for further discussion on this matter. Please advise in your return mail, which time is confidential enough to call you. And also call me if you are interested in the proposal with this number - 234 8 Looking forward to hearing from you. Best Regards, James Abuse. ",d08,Government and Legal Affairs,"GENERAL SETTINGS
