ou indicate your option towards assisting me as I believe that this transaction would be concluded within fourteen (14)days you should signify your willingness to assist me. As I am Looking to hear from you soon.  Thanks and God bless.  Miss Chroma Maduro.  		--------------------------------- Faiths de Yahoo! vote page d'actual SUR LE web pour retriever divestment Los services prosecute;feature;rescue;s : acute;rifle Los Bordeaux mails, Lance Los recherche set survey l'actualit&eacute; en temps rescue;El. Clique ICI.",d10,Insurance,"GENERAL SETTINGS
